-- Keep temporary relations after trusted application relations.
-- PostgreSQL implicitly searches pg_temp first when it is omitted. A caller
-- with TEMP privilege could otherwise replace an unqualified membership table
-- used by a privileged function. Bodies, argument types, ownership and grants
-- stay unchanged. This explicit list includes only application-owned functions.
